From a5dbe2c488e839325e4e55b7a600d93bbc7e6ba5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brenda Streiff <brenda.streiff@emerson.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Nov 2025 13:24:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fetch2/nuget: add a nuget fetcher

Adds a fetcher to retrieve artifacts from NuGet package repositories.

This fetcher contains a basic handrolled implementation of the NuGet V3
API in order to not rely on the NuGet.exe client.

The implementation otherwise is significantly cribbed from the NPM fetcher,
which is otherwise similar in its approach (e.g. having to contact a package
registry in order to obtain a true download URL).

Signed-off-by: Brenda Streiff <brenda.streiff@emerson.com>
